# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
# React Router owns the routes, but Cloudflare only knows about files on disk —
# so a refresh or a shared link to /scores would 404 without this. Serve
# index.html with a 200 (not a 302) and let the router resolve the path.
# Vite copies everything in public/ to the dist root, so this ships as-is.
/*    /index.html   200
